    "title": "Northland home damaged in house fire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gabe Swartz ,\n9 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. (KCTV) - A house fire in the Northland Wednesday morning significantly damaged a home. The Kansas City Missouri Fire Department said it responded to the 700 block of NE 98th Terrace at 11:12 a.m. Wednesday. When crews arrived, they reported heavy smoke and fire from a 1.5-story home. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
